#: src/one_public_api/routers/authenticate_router.py:56
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Login"

#: src/one_public_api/routers/authenticate_router.py:57
msgid "Login Description"
msgstr ""
"**SYS-ATH-P-LGN**<br />Validates the provided username and password "
"against the records stored in the database.<br />If the credentials are "
"correct, the system issues an access token and a refresh token. If "
"authentication fails and the username exists, the system increments the "
"login failure count. Once the count reaches the limit defined by "
"`MAX_FAILED_ATTEMPTS`, the system locks the account. If the username does"
" not exist, an error is returned.<br />When the `rememberMe` field is set"
" to `true`, the refresh token cookie remains valid until the period "
"specified by the `REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE` setting expires.<br />If set to "
"`false`, the cookie is deleted when the browser session ends."

